00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:35.126
No.


00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:40.242
Asshole.


00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.763
The light, goddammit!


00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:52.731
Well, here,
we're in the room where we all sleep.


00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:58.047
My relationship with my parents
